{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n\n<p>發佈時間：09:32 2026-10-05 HKT</p>\n<p>今(5日)早上8時44分，一名著校服15歲中學女生，在尖沙咀梳士巴利道鐘樓對開，被發現在海中載浮載沉，途人見狀落水將她救起，她仍然清醒，被送往廣華醫院檢查。警方正調查女生企圖自殺原因。</p>\n<img alt=\"女生獲救送院檢查。梁國峰攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/695163464b38f5b354c93e7658ebba5c/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-05_at_09_20_11.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/cac765a6343548fe13ddd64cb8cd54d6/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-05_at_09_20_12.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"警員到場調查。梁國峰攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/07d0d61b55baf699281a1f27ad497c4d/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-05_at_09_20_11_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"警員到場調查。梁國峰攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/86091858e7bb7f4c4b3ed8a8e021a089/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-05_at_09_20_10_3_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/04c549a0e8af8f3516c1b884ba88d055/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-05_at_09_20_10_2_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"女生在尖沙咀鐘樓對開墮海獲救。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/49f3e5fd621ef929b94556f2bcd8ac3d/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-05_at_09_20_10.jpeg\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-05T03:19:35.215164+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":118,"images":6,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}